# Source-derived semantics

- The source contains one instruction paragraph followed by one empty 200px by 200px div.
- The tested declaration is background: scroll green repeat-x bottom; and is preserved verbatim.
- The no-image case intentionally uses the green fill as a parser oracle while repeat, position, and attachment remain visually inert.

# Compatibility adjustments

- Visible text uses wrapping outer text, nested bold text, and ordinary U+0020; the box selector is class-scoped.
- Content-box sizing and explicit body/paragraph spacing are setup-only Web compatibility adjustments.

# Current Lynx API-doc basis

- Background attachment is unsupported. The exact shorthand remains pending visual verification without a longhand workaround.
